{"title":"Classic Store","slug":"Classic_Store","pageid":889,"revid":17003,"timestamp":"2025-01-22T09:25:02Z","lastEditor":"Fireknight4802","categories":["Locations","Stores"],"infobox":{"type":"Buildings","fields":[{"label":"NPC","value":"Adin18572"},{"label":"Purpose","value":"Buying classic ROBLOX items."},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.13.0"},{"label":"Island","value":"Classic Biome {{!}} Ferwater"}]},"sections":[{"id":"directions","text":"Directions"},{"id":"inventory","text":"Inventory"}],"body":"<p><br>\nThe <b>Classic Store</b> is a shop that sells classic ROBLOX items, such as coils, drinks, and more. It is owned and ran by adin18572. The shop was added as part of the 4 Million Visits event. The store is located at the far back of the Classic Biome. They always sell the Classic Joop, the Team Flag, and a random 10 of the 19 other items every 12 hours. The stock of the shop is universal between servers, but not all of the restock timers are synced, allowing for certain servers to have previous stocks before all timers fully reset. \n</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"directions\">Directions</h2>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: media file\">media file</span></span>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"inventory\">Inventory</h2>\n<p>This table shows all items available at the store.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"tools\">Tools</h3>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Item\n</th>\n<th>Picture\n</th>\n<th>Cost\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Gravity_Coil/\">Gravity Coil</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Gravity Coil\">Gravity Coil</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$8,008\n</td>\n<td>Can be used to reach heights never seen before.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Healing_Coil/\">Healing Coil</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Healing Coil\">Healing Coil</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$5,117\n</td>\n<td>Can be used to heal numbers never seen before.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Speed_Coil/\">Speed Coil</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Speed Coil\">Speed Coil</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$8,008\n</td>\n<td>Can be used to reach speeds never seen before!\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Rocket_Launcher/\">Rocket Launcher</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Rocket launcher\">Rocket launcher</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$9,999\n</td>\n<td>DAVID BAZOOKA! TO THE MOONNNNNNN.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Linked_Sword/\">Linked Sword</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Linked Sword\">Linked Sword</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$1,337\n</td>\n<td>With blood and iron.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Epicsauce/\">Epicsauce</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Epicsauce\">Epicsauce</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$404\n</td>\n<td>Ultimate EPIC juice Brand Epicsauce. Extremely hot.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Witches_Brew/\">Witches Brew</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Whitches Brew\">Whitches Brew</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$404\n</td>\n<td>Do the Brew! Shipped direct from the Haunted Hill soda company.<br>Warning: may cause freakish deformities. Warning: may contain actual witches.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Bloxy_Cola/\">Bloxy Cola</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Bloxi cola\">Bloxi cola</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$737\n</td>\n<td>Warning: Bloxy Cola may be habit-forming.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Subspace_Tripmine/\">Subspace Tripmine</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Subspacetripminereal\">Subspacetripminereal</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$1,010\n</td>\n<td>A hidden deathtrap, waiting to be USED! Powered by purple goop &gt;:D\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Trowel/\">Trowel</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Trowel\">Trowel</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$777\n</td>\n<td>Defend your area with a thing of bricks, while supplies last!\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Slingshot/\">Slingshot</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Slingshot\">Slingshot</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$727\n</td>\n<td>Fire a bunch of marbles at your worst enemies!\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h3 id=\"structures\">Structures</h3>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Item\n</th>\n<th>Picture\n</th>\n<th>Cost\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Classic_Billboard/\">Classic Billboard</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Classic Billboard\">Classic Billboard</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$1,270\n</td>\n<td>Wowzers! A brand new happy home for happy people? For only 50 tix!?\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Team_Flag/\">Team Flag</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Team Flag Boxed\">Team Flag Boxed</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$3,000\n</td>\n<td>Allows you to play capture the flag, a fun way to challenge your enemies. Joining a flag team will forcefully enable PVP for you, allowing you to use any PVP weapons you desire. Take flags from enemy teams and return them back to yours to earn points! Make sure to buy more than one flag post.\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h3 id=\"vehicles\">Vehicles</h3>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Item\n</th>\n<th>Picture\n</th>\n<th>Cost\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Classic_Joop/\">Classic Joop</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Classic Joop Boxed\">Classic Joop Boxed</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$86,000\n</td>\n<td>A portal from above sent this mysterious joop down to this store. So powerful, yet so.. weird...\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h3 id=\"items\">Items</h3>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Item\n</th>\n<th>Picture\n</th>\n<th>Cost\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Stud_Vinyl/\">Stud Vinyl</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Stud vinyl\">Stud vinyl</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$4,444\n</td>\n<td>Huh... I wonder if this thing will ever work?\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Gift_of_Universal_Surfaces/\">Gift Of Universal Surfaces</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\"><span><span>&#91;</span>1<span>&#93;</span></span></sup>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Giftofuniversalsurfacesbox\">Giftofuniversalsurfacesbox</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$390\n</td>\n<td>Wow, the Universable part of surfaces. Impressive, i love gifts!\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/THE_OAK_PIECE/\">THE OAK PIECE</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: THE OAK PIECE\">THE OAK PIECE</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$8,994\n</td>\n<td>IT'S REAL.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Trapped_Beans/\">Trapped Beans</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Beans\">Beans</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$4,891\n</td>\n<td>:) little do they know... I'M SECRETLY A BOMB!\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Canned_Beans/\">Canned Beans</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Beans\">Beans</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$4,891\n</td>\n<td>:) little do they know... I'M NOT A BOMB!\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Baby_Ducky/\">Baby Ducky</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\"><span><span>&#91;</span>2<span>&#93;</span></span></sup>\n</td>\n<td><div><div><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Baby Ducky\">Baby Ducky</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div><div><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Baby Ducky Evil\">Baby Ducky Evil</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>$125\n</td>\n<td>Quack! Quack Quack! QUACKKKKK!!!! QUAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACCCCCCCCCCCCCKKKKKKKKKKKKKKK\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Classic_Moai/\">Classic Moai</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Classic Moai\">Classic Moai</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$1,250\n</td>\n<td>Ooga ooga ooga chaga ooga ooga ooga chaga ooga ooga ooga chaga.. but retro..\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div><ol>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span><span>↑</span></span> <span>The Gift Of Universal Surfaces gives you a singular, gray classic stud when unwrapped.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><span><span>↑</span></span> <span>When buying, there is a chance that the duck will become Evil. Evil duck does not change its description and name, it differs only in appearance.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"a1205cf7b19b3d355c65aa38ebe1a5e9\" data-seq-no=\"0\"><div></div><div><div><div id=\"Screenshot_2023-08-26_094841-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: The old appearance of the store, back when it was located in the Desert Highlands.\">The old appearance of the store, back when it was located in the Desert Highlands.</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: The old appearance of the store, back when it was located in the Desert Highlands.\">The old appearance of the store, back when it was located in the Desert Highlands.</span></span></div></div><div>The old appearance of the store, back when it was located in the Desert Highlands.</div></div></div>"}
